        {
          "ruleId": "ai-slop-cli-orphan-doc",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Move lines 180-181 down to sit directly above `fn library_error`.: The doc comment for library_error (\"Why `--library DIR` can't be opened ... issue #99\") was left stacked on top of library_warnings' own doc, so rustdoc/IDE hover shows a single merged comment on library_warnings and library_error (the function it describes) has no doc at all. Typical result of an edit that inserted a function between a comment and its item."
