        {
          "ruleId": "ai-slop-help-urls-duplicate-links-table",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Serve the link table from the engine (or generate the TS map from links.rs) so there is one source of truth.: HELP_URLS re-types the Help-menu link table that crates/ui-egui/src/links.rs already owns (LINKS/url_of), and the two have already diverged: app.help points to .../tree/main/docs here but to the repository root (HELP) in links.rs. The egui and desktop apps therefore send the same Help command to different pages, and any further URL change must be made twice."
          },
