          "message": {
            "text": "Report every confirm_dialog error (at least a toast, ideally keeping the dialog open as for Export) instead of the catch-all close.: In dialogs::show, a confirm_dialog Err is only reported for Import/Export/ContactSheet/NewAlbum/NewSmartAlbum/SmartRules/KeywordTag/KeywordSet/SynchronizeFolder (toast) and SamModel; every other Err falls into `_ => close = true`, dropping the message. app.run does not toast errors itself. Example: Edit Capture Time with a typed time that is not a date makes photo.setCaptureTime return `... is not a date`, and the dialog simply closes with nothing changed and no message; likewise Rename Photos (on-disk rename failure), Merge (start_final 'a merge is already running' / plan error), Rename Keyword, Label Names, Paste Settings, Cull and Delete failures vanish silently and the user's input is lost."
