          "message": {
            "text": "Keep only rank_correlation_ties (renamed rank_correlation) and call it from fit_partial_on too; re-run the corpus look tests and bump LOOK_VERSION if any accepted look changes.: rank_correlation and rank_correlation_ties are two near-identical 20-line Spearman implementations; the second only adds tie handling (mean rank) and a symmetric variance guard. fit_partial_on still uses the weaker one while fit_tone_only_on and fit_tone_with_shadows use the tie-aware one, so quantized-luminance JPEGs are scored two different ways against the same PARTIAL_MIN_RANK_CORRELATION threshold."
