          "ruleId": "schema-manifest-tile-exceeds-remote-limit",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Use one shared tile limit: either cap manifest tiles at the remote/GPU limit (1024) or raise remote::MAX_TILE (and its payload bounds) to the manifest's 2048.: Manifest validation accepts tiles up to 2048 cells, but the remote denoise protocol caps tiles at MAX_TILE = 1024, and serve() refuses to start beyond that. A valid model with tile 1536 installs and runs locally, but `lightcraft-cli denoise-serve` fails with 'tile size 1536 is outside 1..=1024', so its remote denoise can never be used. The two contracts disagree on the accepted range."
